### -----< LOGIN API >----- ###
### REGISTER
POST {{time_keeper.Server_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
{"username":"{{username}}","password":"{{password}}"}


### LOGIN
POST {{time_keeper.Server_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
{"username":"{{username}}","password":"{{password}}"}


### REFRESH TOKENS
POST {{time_keeper.Server_HostAddress}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json
{"refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"}


### REVOKE (Log out)
POST {{time_keeper.Server_HostAddress}}/api/auth/revoke
Content-Type: application/json
{"refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"}


### CHECK ACCESS TOKEN
Get {{time_keeper.Server_HostAddress}}/api/auth/protected
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}



### -----< CONTENT API >----- ###
### WEATHER
GET {{time_keeper.Server_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast
Accept: application/json


### CLOCK-IN
POST {{time_keeper.Server_HostAddress}}/api/timeentries/clock-in
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### CLOCK-OUT
POST {{time_keeper.Server_HostAddress}}/api/timeentries/clock-out
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### LIST ENTRIES
GET {{time_keeper.Server_HostAddress}}/api/timeentries
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}